<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<definitions xmlns="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="defs_to_be_01_bank_soal" targetNamespace="http://cbt-smk-v2/bpmn/to-be" exporter="CBT SMK v2 Tim To-Be BPMN" exporterVersion="1.0">
  <process id="to_be_01_bank_soal" name="To-Be 01 Pembuatan Bank Soal" isExecutable="false">
    <documentation>To-Be 01 — Pembuatan Bank Soal DENGAN aplikasi CBT SMK v2.

Alur: Guru membuat bank soal baru (satu mapel + satu tingkat), mengisi metadata,
lalu mengisi soal dengan dua cara: manual lewat RichEditor, atau import berkas
Excel (.xlsx) / Word (.docx) yang divalidasi sistem dan ditampilkan pratinjaunya.
Soal hasil import masuk berstatus DRAF. Setelah telaah oleh penelaah kedua
(bukan penulis soal), bank diajukan untuk dikunci dan sistem mengunci bank.

Asumsi: (1) Satu bank soal hanya untuk satu mapel + satu tingkat. (2) Soal hasil
import berstatus DRAF dan wajib ditelaah sebelum dipakai paket ujian.
(3) Pemisahan tugas (SoD): pembuat bank BUKAN pengunci bank.
(4) Bank yang terkunci tidak bisa ditambah/diedit isinya; perbaikan dilakukan
lewat duplikat bank. (5) CSV TIDAK didukung untuk import soal.
(6) Label tipe soal jujur: 5 tipe standar AKM + 11 varian/ekstensi aplikasi.

Fakta aplikasi yang dipakai: endpoint CRUD bank soal + lock/unlock
(KONTRAK §8.3); import Excel/Word + preview + soal DRAF
(PANDUAN-IMPORT-SOAL.md); telaah orang kedua (ANALISIS Bab 5.4);
lock bank 2 lapis (ANALISIS Bab 5.4).</documentation>
    <laneSet id="laneset_to_be_01_bank_soal">
      <lane id="lane_0" name="Guru">
        <flowNodeRef>start</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_buat</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_meta</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>g_cara</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_manual</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_kunci</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_unggah</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_perbaiki</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>g_lagi</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_telaah</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>g_kunci</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_ajukan</flowNodeRef>
      </lane>
      <lane id="lane_1" name="Sistem (CBT SMK v2)">
        <flowNodeRef>t_validasi</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>g_error</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_simpan</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_kunci_sys</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>end</flowNodeRef>
      </lane>
    </laneSet>
    <startEvent id="start" name="Mulai">
      <outgoing>f01</outgoing>
    </startEvent>
    <userTask id="t_buat" name="Buat Bank Soal Baru">
      <incoming>f01</incoming>
      <outgoing>f02</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <userTask id="t_meta" name="Isi Metadata Bank Soal">
      <incoming>f02</incoming>
      <outgoing>f03</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="g_cara" name="Cara Pengisian Soal?">
      <incoming>f03</incoming>
      <incoming>f14</incoming>
      <incoming>f17</incoming>
      <outgoing>f04</outgoing>
      <outgoing>f05</outgoing>
    </exclusiveGateway>
    <userTask id="t_manual" name="Tambah Soal Manual via RichEditor">
      <incoming>f04</incoming>
      <outgoing>f06</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <userTask id="t_kunci" name="Isi Kunci, Bobot, Kompetensi">
      <incoming>f06</incoming>
      <outgoing>f07</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <userTask id="t_unggah" name="Unggah Berkas Import Excel/Word">
      <incoming>f05</incoming>
      <incoming>f11</incoming>
      <outgoing>f08</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_validasi" name="Validasi Berkas dan Tampilkan Pratinjau">
      <incoming>f08</incoming>
      <outgoing>f09</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="g_error" name="Ada Error?">
      <incoming>f09</incoming>
      <outgoing>f10</outgoing>
      <outgoing>f12</outgoing>
    </exclusiveGateway>
    <userTask id="t_perbaiki" name="Perbaiki Berkas Import">
      <incoming>f10</incoming>
      <outgoing>f11</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_simpan" name="Simpan Soal Hasil Import">
      <incoming>f12</incoming>
      <outgoing>f13</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="g_lagi" name="Tambah Soal Lagi?">
      <incoming>f07</incoming>
      <incoming>f13</incoming>
      <outgoing>f14</outgoing>
      <outgoing>f15</outgoing>
    </exclusiveGateway>
    <userTask id="t_telaah" name="Telaah Soal oleh Penelaah Kedua">
      <incoming>f15</incoming>
      <outgoing>f16</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="g_kunci" name="Bank Siap Dikunci?">
      <incoming>f16</incoming>
      <outgoing>f17</outgoing>
      <outgoing>f18</outgoing>
    </exclusiveGateway>
    <userTask id="t_ajukan" name="Ajukan Penguncian Bank Soal">
      <incoming>f18</incoming>
      <outgoing>f19</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_kunci_sys" name="Kunci Bank Soal">
      <incoming>f19</incoming>
      <outgoing>f20</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <endEvent id="end" name="Selesai: Bank Terkunci">
      <incoming>f20</incoming>
    </endEvent>
    <sequenceFlow id="f01" sourceRef="start" targetRef="t_buat" />
